{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1529986-random-exigent-idea","id":1529986,"title":"Random Exigent idea","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Exigents"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-02-04T16:03:54-08:00","id":1529986,"title":"Random Exigent idea","content":"[commits grand forum necromancy]<br /> <br /> So I had a look at Ohanlei (goddess of tea!) in the Sidereal manuscript, and I was curious about what an Exigent of hers would be like.<br /> <br /> Alas, I don\u2019t have access to the Exigent manuscript, so I\u2019ll just forward the idea to you guys. What perks do you think would come with Ohanlei\u2019s blessing?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Teller of Tales, and the Weaver of Dreams<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/14qUE6JyfwtXyd8SMY5gSJ_vvUZPCvGDZiIbBk19QPiU/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Behold! My 2e characters.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13327-voyd211","name":"Voyd211","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13327_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"221"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-04T18:30:50-08:00","id":1529995,"title":"","content":"Why did she want a Chosen? For what purpose was this Exigent created?<br /> This does effect the some of the baseline assumptions when creating an Exigent.<br /> Source (what is the god of) and purpose (why do they need an Exalt) very much colour the initial Exigent design decisions. That can impact things like 'tier' and type (Ability, Attribute, etc)<br /> <br /> <br /> I imagine the Exigent is Ability based; both Performance and Socialize could play a part in tea ceremonies &amp; culture. Of course, if the Exigent was created for violet purposes, this would impact the charm set significantly. &quot;Punish the breach of Etiquette&quot; charms for those abilities could be interesting, but would be limiting if they need to smite some bandits.<br /> Alternatively, it could be an &quot;Essence only&quot; based charm set, heavily building on prerequisite charms. (This is for weird, unintuitive powers, like puppets). &quot;Tea as potions/brews&quot; could result in a very different kind of Exigent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-05T06:54:24-08:00","id":1530023,"title":"","content":"Yes, as FallenEco pointed out and summed up quite well, the whys and hows of her getting an Exigence (was she truly worthy or did she acquire one through favors, bribery or outright criminal ways?) can matter as much as the deity's personality, power and charmset in defining the form and style of its chosen.<br /> <br /> <br /> An Exigent can fit anywhere in the power scale from sub-terrestrial to borderline solaroid depending on what works best for a story and group's preferences - and that in itself does not adress what kind of style or crazy mechanic tricks or limitations one might bake into such a Exigent.<br /> <br /> - Must tea be served warm or fresh?<br /> - Does cold/iced tea count as real tea, is it juice under another name (and how do Ohanlei - or the God of Juice - feel about that) or the concept cold/iced tea even exist in Creation?<br /> - Could such a charmset have an aura-like quality related to degree of presentation/cerimonial preparation involved in offering the tea or something else altogether?<br /> <br /> Lots of directions or gimmicks one might pull out or restrict about this depending on one's interests and imagination.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 04-29-2024, 01:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}